       to open a ddddpp socket or SSOOCCKK__RRAAWW to open a rraaww socket.  _p_r_o_t_o_c_o_l is the
       AppleTalk protocol to be received or sent.  For SSOOCCKK__RRAAWW you must spec‐
       ify AATTPPRROOTTOO__DDDDPP.

       Raw sockets may be opened only by a process with effective user ID 0 or
